        "top_subheading": "Brand Story",
        "tophead_mb": 60,
        "content": "<p>It began with a simple question: how can jewelry feel more human? Not louder, not heavier—just more true to the moments that shape a life.</p><p>From the first sketches to the final polish, ECGLOSTY grew from that question. We set out to create pieces that celebrate individuality and preserve cherished memories—quietly elegant, carefully made, and ready to live with you every day.</p><p>Years later, that belief still guides every choice we make: design with purpose, craft with care, and leave room for the story only you can write.</p>",
