        "heading_align": "lgs-text-center",
        "top_heading": "Impact Beyond the Jewel",
        "icon_heading": "las la-gem",
        "top_subheading": "Social Responsibility",
        "tophead_mb": 60,
        "content": "<p>We take a purposeful approach to how jewelry is sourced and crafted, because artistry should respect the people and places it comes from.</p><p>From more responsible materials to supporting the hands that bring designs to life, we work to leave a positive imprint—quietly, consistently, and with the same care we give each finished piece.</p><p>For ECGLOSTY, responsibility is not a campaign. It is part of the story we want to keep writing with you.</p>",
