    "brand_about_story_G3UdA8": {
      "type": "brand-about-story",
      "name": "Brand About Story",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "lgs-container",
        "custom_container": "1200px",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-a7daaf06-b576-48f7-a888-22cffc39be11",
        "design_heading": "6",
        "heading_align": "lgs-text-center",
        "top_heading": "Our Beginning",
        "icon_heading": "las la-gem",
        "top_subheading": "",
        "tophead_mb": 30,
        "content": "<h3><strong>A New Definition of Luxury</strong></h3><p>Most jewelry is bought for a moment. The best jewelry is worn through all the ones that follow.<br/><br/>That’s the thought we started with. Not “what will sell” or “what looks good in a case,” but a simpler question: what makes a piece worth reaching for, day after day, year after year?<br/><br/>For us, it comes down to a few things you can’t see in a photo. How a ring sits next to another band. How a necklace moves when you walk. How a pair of earrings becomes so familiar you forget they’re there—until someone else notices.<br/><br/>We make fine jewelry with lab-grown diamonds and solid gold. Not because it’s trendy, but because these materials let us focus on what actually matters: cut, proportion, weight, and the way every detail works together over time.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/4.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "cl_bg": "#ffffff",
        "cl_bg_gradient": "",
        "mg": "0px,0px,0px,0px",
        "pd": "90px,0px,90px,0px",
        "mg_tb": "0px,0px,0px,0px",
        "pd_tb": "50px,0px,50px,0px",
        "mg_mb": "0px,0px,0px,0px",
        "pd_mb": "30px,0px,30px,0px"
      }
    },
