                "text_kebVf3": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Jewelry has always been about meaning. But somewhere along the way, it became about everything else—logos, price tags, occasions you had to wait for.<br/><br/>A ring marks a promise. A necklace carries a memory. A pair of studs becomes a reflex, not a decision. Those are the real reasons jewelry exists. Not to signal status, but to become part of your daily life.<br/><br/>So we started ECGLOSTY with a quiet rule: less about what a piece says about you, more about how it feels when you wear it.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
