    "brand_about_story_4CbWCW": {
      "type": "brand-about-story",
      "name": "Brand About Story",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "custom-container",
        "custom_container": "1200px",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "design_heading": "1",
        "heading_align": "lgs-text-center",
        "top_heading": "What We Actually Do",
        "icon_heading": "las la-gem",
        "top_subheading": "--Luxury Lies in the Details--",
        "tophead_mb": 24,
        "content": "<p>You won’t find overdesigned settings or novelty shapes here. We spend our time on the details that are easy to miss but hard to get right.<br/><br/>The height of a prong—high enough to let the diamond catch light, low enough to stay out of the way.<br/><br/>The thickness of a band—substantial without being heavy, thin enough to stack comfortably.<br/><br/>The relationship between a center stone and the accents around it—balanced, not crowded.<br/><br/>These aren’t marketing points. They’re decisions we make because they affect how a piece wears, not just how it looks on day one.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/f624a8b2-43e4-4f71-9cd8-214fa4af4e8c.png",
        "image_position": "right",
        "cl_bg": "#ffffff",
        "cl_bg_gradient": "",
        "mg": "0px,0px,0px,0px",
        "pd": "90px,0px,90px,0px",
        "mg_tb": "0px,0px,0px,0px",
        "pd_tb": "50px,0px,50px,0px",
