                "text_w3pjBt": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>That choice means you can prioritize a better cut, a clearer stone, or simply a larger diamond for the same budget. It also means you don’t have to compromise on what you value most.<br/><br/>Every diamond we set is selected with the same care we give to the gold and the design. Not because it’s the only way, but because it’s the right way for us.</p>",
