        "text_k3ybjT": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The real test isn’t the first time you put it on. It’s the hundredth time. The morning you reach for it without thinking. The night you forget to take it off and realize it feels like part of you.<br/><br/>That’s what we’re building for.<br/><br/>Solid gold that holds its shape. Settings that stay secure. Proportions that look right from every angle, not just in the mirror.<br/><br/>We can’t decide what your jewelry will come to mean—that part is yours. But we can make sure the piece itself never gets in the way of that meaning.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
