    "brand_about_story_gr7GiV": {
      "type": "brand-about-story",
      "name": "Brand About Story",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "lgs-container",
        "custom_container": "1200px",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "design_heading": "1",
        "heading_align": "lgs-text-center",
        "top_heading": "One Last Thing",
        "icon_heading": "las la-gem",
        "top_subheading": "",
        "tophead_mb": 60,
        "content": "<p>Fine jewelry has a long history, and much of what made it special still holds true. Craftsmanship matters. Materials matter. A well-cut diamond still stops you for a moment.<br/><br/>But luxury doesn’t have to be static. New technology, new values, and new ways of choosing are all part of the same story—just a different chapter.<br/><br/>We respect what came before. We’re just not bound by every rule that came with it.<br/><br/>Because in the end, luxury is simpler than it’s often made to seem:<br/><br/>It’s not about owning more.<br/>It’s about knowing what’s worth keeping.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/049b3584-9a81-4356-8648-f157b32ad22b.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "cl_bg": "#ffffff",
